⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using wrong activation in output layer
❌ Not normalizing data
❌ Too many layers → overfitting
❌ Wrong loss function

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Best Practices

✔ Use ReLU for hidden layers
✔ Use Sigmoid/Softmax in output
✔ Normalize input data
✔ Use dropout to avoid overfitting
✔ Tune learning rate

